@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### Process liveness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### PostgreSQL smoke check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/db

### Assets: bounded page and exact, case-insensitive filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/assets?offset=0&limit=20&symbol=bbca&currency=idr

### Readings: inclusive UTC time window and bounded page
GET {{baseUrl}}/assets/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/readings?observed_from=2026-08-01T00:00:00Z&observed_to=2026-08-18T23:59:59Z&offset=0&limit=100
